                    <p>11-Ketoandrostenedione</p>
                  </dd><dt class="c-abbreviation_list__term u-text-bold u-float-left u-pr-16" style="min-width:50px;"><dfn>AMH:</dfn></dt><dd class="c-abbreviation_list__description u-mb-24">
