ed only minor changes in ovarian gene expression, and DHEA administration reduced the expression of key enzymes in the cholesterol synthesis pathway. Table 2- 19 DEGs (<i>P</i>. adj &lt; 0.05) in hypothalami of female spiny mice aged 23—24 d compared to 7—8 d. Table 5- Primers.</p></div></div><div class="c-article-supplementary__item" data-test="supp-item" id="MOESM2"><h3 class="c-article-supplementary__title u-h3"><a class="print-link" data-track="click" data-track-action="view supplementary info" data-test="supp-info-link" data-track-label="additional file 2: table 1 – loopalltranscriptcoun" href="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1186%2Fs12915-026-02619-2/MediaObjects/12915_2026_2619_MOESM2_ESM.csv" data-supp-info-image="">Additional File 2: Table 1 – LoopAllTranscriptCounts: Counts in hypothalmus and ovary across development. (download CSV <svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-download-medium"></use></svg>)</a></h3></div><div class="c-article-supplementary__item" data-test="supp-item" id="MOESM3"><h3 class="c-article-supplementary__title u-h3"><a class="print-link" data-track="click" data-track-action="view supplementary info" data-test="supp-info-link" data-track-label="additional file 3: table 3- loop ov: 207 degs in o" href="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1186%2Fs12915-026-02619-2/MediaObjects/12915_2026_2619_MOESM3_ESM.csv" data-supp-info-image="">Additional File 3: Table 3- Loop Ov: 207 DEGs in ovary. (download CSV <svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-download-medium"></use></svg>)</a></h3></div><div class="c-article-supplementary__item" data-test="supp-item" id="MOESM4"><h3 class="c-article-supplementary__title u-h3"><a class="print-link" data-track="click" data-track-action="view supplementary info" data-test="supp-info-link" data-track-label="additional file 4: table 4- degs adx: 1453 degs in" href="https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1186%2Fs12915-026-02619-2/MediaObjects/12915_2026_2619_MOESM4_ESM.csv" data-supp-info-image="">Additional File 4: Table 4- DEGs Adx: 1453 DEGs in ovary of Adx vs AdxDHEA spiny mice. (download CSV <svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-download-medium"></use></svg>)</a></h3></div></div></div></div></section><section data-title="Rights and permissions"><div class="c-article-section" id="rightslink-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="rightslink">Rights and permissions</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="rightslink-content">
